--[[
	PayomboyZ UI Library  v1.0.0
	Roblox / Luau — black & red "script hub" window

	Use as a ModuleScript (or any chunk that returns the table):
		local Library = require(path.to.PayomboyUILib)
		local Window  = Library:CreateWindow({ Title = "PayomboyZ", ... })

	Layout (matches the mock-up):
		TopBar   : logo · search · version · status · [close][minimize][hide]
		Sidebar  : tabs · links · banner · mode toggle
		Content  : pages (KEY panel, game grid, sections of controls)
		Right    : KEY status · news · Discord · credit banner
		Footer   : brand · slogan · links

	Main API
		Library:CreateWindow(config)                  -> Window
		Window:AddTab({Name, Icon, SidePanel})        -> Tab
		Tab:AddKeyPanel({OnVerify = fn(key)->ok,info})
		Tab:AddGameGrid({Filter, Sort, Dynamic, Title, Hints})
		Tab:AddSection(title)                         -> Section
		Section:AddToggle / AddSlider / AddButton / AddDropdown / AddInput / AddKeybind / AddLabel
		Window:AddGame({Name, Image, Tags, Status, Premium, RequireKey, Callback})
		Window:AddKeyStatus / AddNews / AddDiscord / AddBanner      (right panel)
		Window:AddSidebarLink / SetSidebarBanner / AddSidebarToggle (sidebar)
		Window:AddFooterLink / SetVersion / SetStatus / SetKeyState
		Window:Notify / SetVisible / Toggle / SetMinimized / Destroy

	Icons: any field that takes an icon accepts a text glyph ("★") or an asset
	("rbxassetid://123" or just the number). Edit Library.Icons / Library.Strings /
	Library.Theme before CreateWindow to change defaults.
]]

